  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-01-31T04:43:43.783Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It's very easy to activate gestures accidentally on Vive, and those gestures will remain activated until the player notices it and activates another gesture.\n\nWhat if we could turn off toggle in the options, so that when you lift your thumb off the touchpad, your gesture goes back to default?\n\nReally hoping for more attention to Vive controls, especially when the Knuckles controllers are nowhere to be seen.",
